[offset:00:00:50]
[00:21.35]There's a fire burning within me
[00:24.31](Enough to set a mind alight)
[00:25.42]Keeps me safe from what hurts me
[00:27.50]That's why it started, but there's burns on my heart now
[00:30.99]All cauterized and scarred up
[00:32.73](Doesn't do much more than hurt us)
[00:34.88]And I still fight as much as I'm able
[00:37.86](Held up by a greatsword)
[00:39.09]But that can't hide all the pain felt
[00:41.09]I'm a stalwart soldier, kept warm by a fire
[00:44.73]It can burn so gentle
[00:46.40](So why is it painful?)
[00:48.15]You can be so gentle, when I get done fighting
[00:51.56]Maybe I'm a lover, not a soldier struggling
[00:55.26]You're my shield, loyal light
[00:58.41]A gentle warmth in the blackest night
[01:01.88]I'm your charge, you're my guard
[01:05.27]So I'll just stay right by your side
[01:08.84]I forget myself sometimes
[01:12.35]When I'm lost then you remind
[01:15.33]I am your sword, hold me tight
[01:19.20]Keep me safe right by your side
[01:29.96](If I'm playing with fire I'm bound to get burned)
[01:33.38]But I know there's more than the surface
[01:36.00]I can learn to love you, and you'll burn to fuel me
[01:39.51](There's more to the flame than the pain)
[01:41.92](Come and be my blaze)
[01:43.73]And we'll keep to the paths you light up
[01:46.41](Like candles to guide me)
[01:47.70]So much fighting before us
[01:49.59]But the thing with fire
[01:51.59]There's a lot it's good for
[01:53.29]Destruction and healing
[01:55.02](Or forging a greatsword)
[01:58.33]
[02:03.49]I'm a weapon of passion that's held with intention
[02:07.06]And you are the wielder of tempered emotion
[02:10.67]You're my moon, loyal light
[02:13.88]You orbit 'round and pull my tides
[02:17.50]I reach out towards the skies
[02:20.75]So I can stay right by your side
[02:24.34]I forget my worth sometimes
[02:27.56]But I was forged in love as fire
[02:30.77]I am your sword, hold me tight
[02:34.64]Keep me safe right by your side
[02:38.48]There's a fire aflame in my heart that'll never burn away
[02:45.55]It's feeling and passion, the ardor of comfort and pain
[02:51.96]It would kill if I tried to deny or to live off of the blaze
[02:58.94]So I dance in between with the pyre to forge my blade
[03:04.99]